OL,3,GNEWSALifeline for care home at risk of
OL,4,Aclosure
OL,5,
OL,6,FA volunteer at a care home facing
OL,7,Fclosure has urged the council to
OL,8,Freconsider its plans after a potential
OL,9,Fbuyer came forward to save the
OL,10,Ffacility.
OL,12,FThe future of the Henry Cornish Care
OL,13,FCentre in Chipping Norton is in doubt
OL,14,Fafter Oxfordshire County Council
OL,15,Flaunched a consultation over plans to
OL,16,Fclose it and save #460,000.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,338,330,200,160,0,100
