OL,3,GNEWSALifeline for care home at risk of
OL,4,Aclosure
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Roger Tyrrell, who has helped at
OL,7,Fthe centre since his mother passed away
OL,8,Fthere last year, said staff and
OL,9,Fresidents were hopeful after a private
OL,10,Fprovider contacted the council about
OL,11,Fbuying the home.
OL,13,FA spokesperson for the local authority
OL,14,Fconfirmed it had received interest in
OL,15,Fthe care home, but said no decision had
OL,16,Fbeen made.
